},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/nanase.nishino/img/2013/05/12/3037173/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな大きい花束、もらったことない！嬉しい(T∀T；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れいかは赤\nせいらりんは黄色\nななは白"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公演の間は泣かん！と思ってたんですが、感動で涙がぼろぼろ(T∀T；)\n幸せです！\nありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問に答える"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●ジンベイザメ見たことありますか?\nあります！大阪の海遊館で。\n体と口が大きくて、ゆったり泳いでて優しそうで、可愛かった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●信号変わんの待ってる時どこ見てる?\n携帯か、信号機か、交通量ですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●天体観測は好き？\n宇宙とか星は好きなんですが、実際に天体観測はしたことがありません(T∀T；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/nanase.nishino/img/2013/05/12/3037173/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいっっっ"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-40243":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわ♡\nろってぃーだよー．"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"newシングルのジャケ写衣装．"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2017/08/11/8150757/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のジャケ写，\n凄くいいよね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Tシャツとデニム．"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"happy♡♡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2017/08/11/8150757/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そーいや初日ゲネプロ，生駒の舞台『モマの火星探検』をみてきました‼︎"},{"type":"